      "title": "Note: Model Links",
      "properties": {
        "text": "## RX 6700 XT / gfx1031 model set\n\nThis workflow uses the W4A8 diffusion model and INT4 text encoder from Winnougan/MiniMax-H3-INT4_Convrot_ComfyUI. The two VAEs come from Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3. Run `download-minimax-h3-models.bat -AcceptLicenses` to download the exact pinned revisions and verify SHA-256.\n\nThe 608x352, 2-second, 15-step preset is the first-run validation target for a 12 GiB RX 6700 XT. Increase duration first, then resolution. This starter graph contains no LoRA loader and does not require the optional Turbo LoRA."
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## RX 6700 XT / gfx1031 model set\n\nThis workflow uses the W4A8 diffusion model and INT4 text encoder from Winnougan/MiniMax-H3-INT4_Convrot_ComfyUI. The two VAEs come from Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3. Run `download-minimax-h3-models.bat -AcceptLicenses` to download the exact pinned revisions and verify SHA-256.\n\nThe 608x352, 2-second, 15-step preset is the first-run validation target for a 12 GiB RX 6700 XT. Increase duration first, then resolution. This starter graph contains no LoRA loader and does not require the optional Turbo LoRA."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## RX 6700 XT / gfx1031 model set\n\nThis workflow uses the W4A8 diffusion model and INT4 text encoder from Winnougan/MiniMax-H3-INT4_Convrot_ComfyUI. The two VAEs come from Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3. Run `download-minimax-h3-models.bat -AcceptLicenses` to download the exact pinned revisions and verify SHA-256.\n\nThe 608x352, 2-second, 15-step preset is the first-run validation target for a 12 GiB RX 6700 XT. Increase duration first, then resolution. This starter graph contains no LoRA loader and does not require the optional Turbo LoRA."
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
